{"id":51747,"date":"2026-06-19T06:40:30","date_gmt":"2026-06-19T05:40:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51747"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:50:53","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:50:53","slug":"taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"TAUT \u2013 Terras do Anci\u00e3o Ultra Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">TAUT \u2013 Terras do Anci\u00e3o Ultra Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">TAUT \u2013 Terras do Anci\u00e3o Ultra Trail 2027<\/strong> (13\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">14 a 21 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, com centro log\u00edstico no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Parque Empresarial do Campor\u00eas<\/strong>, em <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ansi\u00e3o<\/strong>, distrito de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Leiria<\/strong>. Sob o conceito \u00abA Alian\u00e7a da Pedra\u00bb, esta semana \u00e9pica de trail running afirma-se como etapa oficial de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o em Portugal para o Campeonato Mundial de Endurance e integra em exclusivo o circuito mundial <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">TORX\u00ae eXperience<\/strong>, pontuando igualmente para o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">UTMB Index<\/strong> e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">ITRA National League<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A grande novidade desta edi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 a estreia do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">The Ancient Quest 500K<\/strong> (aproximadamente 500 km e 23.000 m D+ com 165 horas de tempo limite, a solo ou em estafeta de 2 a 3 atletas), desenhado em formato \u00abborboleta\u00bb com tr\u00eas an\u00e9is que partem e regressam a Ansi\u00e3o rumo \u00e0 <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pampilhosa da Serra<\/strong> (250 km), <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Soure<\/strong> (100 km) e <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Porto de M\u00f3s<\/strong> (160 km). Atravessando 22 concelhos e 70 freguesias entre o maci\u00e7o calc\u00e1rio da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Serra de Sic\u00f3<\/strong> e as <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Fragas de S\u00e3o Sim\u00e3o<\/strong>, o evento inclui ainda o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">TAUTE XL+ 150 Milhas<\/strong> (240 km, 9.639 m D+), <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">TAUTE XL 100 Milhas<\/strong> (160 km, 7.726 m D+), <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">TAUTE 100K<\/strong> (110 km, 3.872 m D+), <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">TAUT 62K<\/strong> (com partida na Sert\u00e3 e 2.236 m D+), <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">TATL 35K<\/strong> (1.500 m D+), <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">TATS 20K<\/strong> (690 m D+), <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">TATJ 13K<\/strong> (370 m D+), <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Nordic Walking \/ Caminhada<\/strong> e o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">TAKIDS<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">ANSIBIKERS - Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Praticantes de BTT<\/strong> em parceria com o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Munic\u00edpio de Ansi\u00e3o<\/strong>, o evento \u00e9 prova candidata ao Circuito Nacional da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">ATRP<\/strong> e integra o Circuito Distrital da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">ADAL<\/strong> e o Circuito Municipal de Ansi\u00e3o. A competi\u00e7\u00e3o destaca-se tamb\u00e9m pelo segmento cronometrado de 590 metros <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Angel Challenge (\u00abSubida do Anjo\u00bb)<\/strong> e pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ranking Bianual 2026\/2027<\/strong> com premia\u00e7\u00e3o monet\u00e1ria (Prize Money) para o Top 8 masculino e feminino de cada dist\u00e2ncia.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; wo