 line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/08 a 30\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">5\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 22,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12\/2026 a 13\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada \/ Nordic Walking<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Nordic Walking (NW) & Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 21 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15 \u2022 370m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 8,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (07\/03 a 08\/03\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (09\/03 a 15\/03\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/03 a 31\/07\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/08 a 30\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">5\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 22,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12\/2026 a 13\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o TAUT \u2013 Terras do Anci\u00e3o Ultra Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 13\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do TAUT realiza-se de 14 a 21 de fevereiro de 2027 (com Training Camp oficial a 13 e 14 de fevereiro para os atletas dos 500K), tendo como centro nevr\u00e1lgico e secretariado o Parque Empresarial do Campor\u00eas e a sede da Ansibikers, em Ansi\u00e3o (distrito de Leiria). A prova de 62 km (TAUT) tem partida espec\u00edfica na Sert\u00e3 e meta em Ansi\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, hor\u00e1rios de partida e tempos limite de cada prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra: The Ancient Quest 500K Solo e Estafeta (500 km, 23.000 m D+, partida a 14\/02 \u00e0s 14:30, limite 165h); TAUTE XL+ 150 Milhas (240 km, 9.639 m D+, partida a 18\/02 \u00e0s 18:30, limite 60h); TAUTE XL 100 Milhas (160 km, 7.726 m D+, partida a 18\/02 \u00e0s 22:30, limite 50h); TAUTE 100K (110 km, 3.872 m D+, partida a 19\/02 \u00e0s 21:30, limite 28h); TAUT 62K (62 km, 2.236 m D+, partida na Sert\u00e3 a 20\/02 \u00e0s 09:00, limite 14h); TAKIDS (20\/02 \u00e0s 15:00); TATL 35K (35 km, 1.500 m D+, 21\/02 \u00e0s 08:30, limite 6h); TATS 20K (20 km, 690 m D+, 21\/02 \u00e0s 08:45, limite 4h); TATJ 13K (13 km, 370 m D+, 21\/02 \u00e0s 09:00, limite 3h) e Nordic Walking \/ Caminhada (21\/02 \u00e0s 09:15).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do TAUT 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a 13 de fevereiro de 2027 \u00e0s 23:59 e dividem-se em 5 fases (sujeitas a limite de vagas por fase): 1\u00aa Fase (7-8 Mar 2026), 2\u00aa Fase (9-15 Mar 2026), 3\u00aa Fase (16 Mar a 31 Jul 2026), 4\u00aa Fase (1 Ago a 30 Nov 2026) e 5\u00aa Fase (1 Dez 2026 a 13 Fev 2027). Os valores variam entre 8\u20ac e 22\u20ac nos 13K\/NW, 10\u20ac a 27\u20ac nos 20K, 12\u20ac a 35\u20ac nos 35K, 25\u20ac a 85\u20ac nos 62K, 60\u20ac a 130\u20ac nos 100K, 70\u20ac a 150\u20ac nas 100 Milhas, 200\u20ac a 500\u20ac nas 150 Milhas, 400\u20ac a 750\u20ac nos 500K Solo e 480\u20ac a 900\u20ac nos 500K Estafeta.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que certifica\u00e7\u00f5es internacionais e material obrigat\u00f3rio s\u00e3o exigidos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas longas integram o circuito mundial TORX\u00ae eXperience (500K, 150M, 100M e 100K), pontuam para o UTMB Index (100M, 100K, 50K e 20K) e ITRA National League (at\u00e9 6 pontos ITRA), al\u00e9m dos circuitos ATRP e ADAL. Nos percursos de 500K, 150M, 100M, 100K e 62K \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3ria a navega\u00e7\u00e3o com aparelho\/rel\u00f3gio GPS com autonomia para gravar no m\u00ednimo 10.000 pontos, al\u00e9m de frontal (m\u00edn. 400 lumens), luz traseira, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito, copo, telem\u00f3vel e reserva h\u00eddrica.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam o levantamento de dorsais, o Angel Challenge e o Prize Money Bianual?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona na sede da ANSIBIKERS, em Ansi\u00e3o, a partir de quinta-feira (18 de fevereiro \u00e0s 16:00) e sexta-feira (19 de fevereiro \u00e0s 18:30), sendo obrigat\u00f3rio apresentar o Cart\u00e3o de Cidad\u00e3o ou Passaporte e entregar o Termo de Responsabilidade impresso. Todos os finalistas (exceto 13K) disputam o trof\u00e9u Angel Challenge na \u00abSubida do Anjo\u00bb (590 metros), e os atletas que concluam as edi\u00e7\u00f5es de 2026 e 2027 habilitam-se ao Prize Money do Ranking Bianual at\u00e9 ao 8\u00ba lugar geral masculino e feminino.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"TAUT \u2013 Terras do Anci\u00e3o Ultra Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-14\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ansi\u00e3o, Leiria\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Ansi\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O TAUT \u2013 Terras do Anci\u00e3o Ultra Trail 2027 decorre de 14 a 21 de fevereiro em Ansi\u00e3o. Provas de 500 km a 13 km, Kids e Caminhada. Consulta guia e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"The Ancient Quest 500K (Solo)\", \"price\": \"650.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"The Ancient Quest 500K (Estafeta 2-3 Atletas)\", \"price\": \"750.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TAUTE XL+ 150M (150 Milhas)\", \"price\": \"350.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TAUTE XL 100M (100 Milhas)\", \"price\": \"135.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TAUTE 100K (Ultra Trail Endurance)\", \"price\": \"110.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TAUT 62K (Partida na Sert\u00e3)\", \"price\": \"65.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TATL 35K (Trail Longo)\", \"price\": \"30.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TATS 20K (Trail Sprint)\", \"price\": \"25.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TATJ 13K (Trail Jovem \/ Mini Trail)\", \"price\": \"20.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Nordic Walking (NW) & Caminhada\", \"price\": \"20.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/taut-terras-do-anciao-ultra-trail-2027\"}]}<\/script><script t